{"id":"e67b18d4faf06437","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Cons.md","title":"Cons","display":"Cons","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"Cons","parameters":["a","p","q"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"Cons"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>a</span><span>p</span><span>q</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：基础。有序参数：<code>a</code>、<code>p</code>、<code>q</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ Cons a p q)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists n\n  (exists m\n    (exists z\n      (and\n        (@ Seq p n)\n        (and\n          (@ Succ n m)\n          (and\n            (@ Seq q m)\n            (and\n              (@ Num0 z)\n              (and\n                (@ App q z a)\n                (forall i (implies (in i n) (exists j (exists x (and (@ Succ i j) (and (@ App p i x) (@ App q j x)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" href=\"?note=1d9ce9ba5108a31b\" title=\"ZFC_Succ\">Succ</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ Cons a p q)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Seq","status":"resolved","id":"ae1f2bbcc1dff983","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Succ","status":"resolved","id":"1d9ce9ba5108a31b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Seq|Seq]]；[[ZFC_Succ|Succ]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":1096,"backlinks":[{"id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Cons|Cons]]"},{"id":"d526fda4e7f7fe48","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CCon